🧠 COMMON DOUBTS
--------------------------------
❓ *Q: Can I access class variables hierarchically like signals?*  
➡️ No, classes are not part of static simulation hierarchy.  You use object handles instead.

❓ *Q: Why can I see modules and interfaces but not classes in the waveform?*  
➡️ Because classes live in the software memory, not in the hardware simulation tree.

❓ *Q: Why do we connect virtual interfaces using hierarchy (tb_top.if_inst)?*  
➡️ Because that’s the real, physical instance name in the simulation tree.

